  "id": "mci",
  "term": "MCI",
  "definition": "MCI stands for mild cognitive impairment, a term for the stage between typical cognitive aging and more clearly impaired or dysfunctional cognitive aging. It commonly refers to performance about 1 to 1.5 standard deviations below age-based norms on cognitive testing, and it may be amnestic when memory is mainly affected or non-amnestic when other thinking abilities are mainly affected.",
